# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
#
# NOTE: an allowlist form of this file (exclude "**", then "!**/*.go" to
# re-include) does NOT work under Podman/buildah — negating a file whose
# parent directory was excluded by a wildcard is silently ignored, so the
# build context ends up empty except for top-level files. Denylist form
# instead: exclude what we don't want, let everything else (including all
# source directories) through.

.git
.github
.devcontainer
bin
docs
assets
hack
helm
*.md

**/*_test.go
